atar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Perfect balance of casual and hardcore gaming. Surface level gameplay and mechanics are addicting to say the least but once you get into the details you can really exploit how items stack and scale to take it to the next level. The challenges are thoughtful and engaging, allowing you to unlock secrets ranging from characters/items/enemies/worlds.\n\nDon't underestimate the world design once you start finding the boundaries, there are so many details hidden throughout the levels. That's not to say it doesn't become visually mesmerizing as you start to rampage through hordes of enemies.\n\nI don't love the music tbh, I usually put on a playlist and just leave the SFX up. \n \nGive it a shot, if you find yourself not loving it then you can always return it if you've played under 2 hours. I'm willing to bet you won't though", "timestamp_created": 1603487773, "timestamp_updated": 1603487773, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}]}